--TEST--
a shape alias written after `#[` is `E1005`, and its fix rewrites the alias to an attribute declaration on the site of this use, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`, `rule:ide/a-code-action-ships-only-a-fix-a-diagnostic-already-knows`
--FILE--
<?nvs
/// Caches the result of a method.
type Cache = { ttlSeconds: int };

class Pages
{
    #[Ca<|>che(ttlSeconds: 60)]
    public function home(): void {}
}
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
3:1-3:34 quickfix rewrite the `type` alias as `attribute Cache on method` -> "attribute Cache on method { ttlSeconds: int }"
